<%--
_Sys_Unauthorized - the panel's access-denied body.

$message - the sentence shown [optional]

Registered as the SPA's unauthorized screen (_Sys_Error_Screens). It offers no
link: the panel cannot know where the application's home is, and the sidebar is
still on screen around it.
--%>
<Define:_Sys_Unauthorized tag="div">
    <% const _message = this.args.message || 'You do not have permission to view this page.'; %>
    <_Sys_Empty_State $icon="bi-shield-lock" $title="Access denied" $body=_message />
</Define:_Sys_Unauthorized>
